info.description:
Colorful Trello lists and blurred background
Currently only the first 5 lists
To color more lists, replace the x with the list number (6 onwards) and the RGB values with the color values you want.
List selector:
.tBRLg6uDC7sSyw:nth-child(x) > .Sb_QqNKeadm2oq {
  background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);
}

Card selector:
#board > li:nth-child(x) > div > ol > li > div {
  background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);
}

style.css:
@-moz-document domain("trello.com") {
.tBRLg6uDC7sSyw > .Sb_QqNKeadm2oq {
  filter: brightness(1.3);
}

.tBRLg6uDC7sSyw:nth-child(1) > .Sb_QqNKeadm2oq {
  background-color: rgb(45, 97, 129);
}

.tBRLg6uDC7sSyw:nth-child(2) > .Sb_QqNKeadm2oq {
  background-color: rgb(255, 95, 21);
}

.tBRLg6uDC7sSyw:nth-child(3) > .Sb_QqNKeadm2oq {
  background-color: rgb(85, 107, 47);
}

.tBRLg6uDC7sSyw:nth-child(4) > .Sb_QqNKeadm2oq {
  background-color: rgb(68, 45, 72);
}

.tBRLg6uDC7sSyw:nth-child(5) > .Sb_QqNKeadm2oq {
  background-color: dimgray;
}

#board > li > div > ol > li > div {
  filter: unset;
  box-shadow: 0px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0, 0.6);
}

#board > li:nth-child(1) > div > ol > li > div {
  background-color: rgb(39, 85, 111);
}

#board > li:nth-child(2) > div > ol > li > div {
  background-color: rgb(135, 71, 19);
}

#board > li:nth-child(3) > div > ol > li > div {
  background-color: rgb(77, 92, 42);
}

#board > li:nth-child(4) > div > ol > li > div {
  background-color: rgb(59, 38, 64);
}

#board > li:nth-child(5) > div > ol > li > div {
  background-color: rgb(90, 90, 90);
}

#content {
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px) brightness(0.8);
  zoom: 133.5%
}
}
